OL,3,GNEWSA'We tried to smuggle contraband
OL,4,Ainto Apocalypse'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mechanic and a Reform UK councillor
OL,7,Fare among 14 people left with no food
OL,8,For water in an abandoned American town
OL,9,Ffor a new Channel 4 reality series.
OL,11,FApocalypse sees strangers attempt to
OL,12,Fsurvive at a site normally used to
OL,13,Ftrain the military while competing for
OL,14,Flimited resources.
OL,16,FAmong the contestants are Louise Baker,
OL,17,F43, from Birmingham and Celia Hibbert,
OL,18,Fthe City of Wolverhampton Council's
OL,19,FReform group leader.
